          "heading": "Fruition is a proud *HubSpot Solutions Partner.*",
          "points": [
            {
              "_key": "80d213b9228a",
              "_type": "vcPoint",
              "body": "Every HubSpot project is run by consultants certified on the platform, not generalists learning on your time.",
              "n": "01",
              "title": "Certified consultants"
            },
            {
              "_key": "e6eb1ebd4b31",
              "_type": "vcPoint",
              "body": "Partner status gives us HubSpot's partner team and roadmap briefings, so issues are escalated properly.",
              "n": "02",
              "title": "A direct line to HubSpot"
            },
            {
              "_key": "71349c6f47b2",
              "_type": "vcPoint",
              "body": "We set up HubSpot alongside the other tools you run, and tell you plainly when it is not the right fit.",
              "n": "03",
              "title": "Built for your whole stack"
            }
          ],
          "tone": "plain"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f675c5b82df7",
          "_type": "vcCards",
          "head": {
            "_type": "vcHead",
            "badge": "Why HubSpot",
            "heading": "What it does *best.*",
            "lead": "Four things teams use HubSpot for every day."
          },
          "imageFrame": "w4-img",
          "items": [
            {
              "_key": "97621e272e04",
              "_type": "vcItem",
              "body": "Company and contact records bring key details, activity and AI summaries together, so sales and service see the same customer history.",
              "image": {
                "_type": "image",
                "alt": "Smart CRM records in HubSpot",
                "asset": {
                  "_ref": "image-694d7c64e91f303ee3fedc4ac812802fc0489e2c-1200x675-webp",
                  "_type": "reference"
                }
              },
              "label": "01",
              "title": "Smart CRM records"
            },
            {
              "_key": "9e8f86e5646e",
              "_type": "vcItem",
              "body": "One workspace shows tasks, outreach, guided actions and the daily schedule. The Prospecting Agent queues emails for review.",
              "image": {
                "_type": "image",
                "alt": "Sales workspace in HubSpot",
                "asset": {
                  "_ref": "image-2abdae46b9685f1e2e8fe4ced2f6f68de22d6d40-1200x675-webp",
                  "_type": "reference"
                }
              },
              "label": "02",
              "title": "Sales workspace"
            },
            {
              "_key": "2132fa3ca179",
              "_type": "vcItem",
              "body": "Health score alerts, at-risk customer views and a shared schedule help service teams act before accounts churn.",
              "image": {
                "_type": "image",
                "alt": "Customer success workspace in HubSpot",
                "asset": {
                  "_ref": "image-594dbb567f57bb578629e54b1e0a569b4ad6a63d-1200x675-webp",
                  "_type": "reference"
                }
              },
              "label": "03",
              "title": "Customer success workspace"
            },
            {
              "_key": "b4bb211c912c",
              "_type": "vcItem",
              "body": "Build nurture workflows with if/then branches, delays and emails, and report on how each step performs.",
              "image": {
                "_type": "image",
                "alt": "Marketing automation workflows in HubSpot",
                "asset": {
                  "_ref": "image-8901c1169867b949e1adf240730bb61708186d6a-1030x772-webp",
                  "_type": "reference"
                }
              },
              "label": "04",
              "title": "Marketing automation workflows"
            }
          ],
          "layout": "why4",
          "tone": "alt"
        },
        {
          "_key": "70dff5d16b84",
          "_type": "vcSteps",
          "head": {
            "_type": "vcHead",
            "badge": "Our approach",
            "heading": "How we deliver *HubSpot.*",
            "lead": "Three steps, the same consultant from scoping to support."
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "_key": "17867c7b2ada",
              "_type": "vcStep",
              "body": "HubSpot’s Marketing Hub is genuinely excellent. We implement it properly and integrate it with the CRM and project platforms you run on.",
              "bullets": [],
              "n": "01",
              "title": "HubSpot where it’s strongest"
            },
            {
              "_key": "fcbfe16eca24",
              "_type": "vcStep",
              "body": "HubSpot’s AI layer, configured with the governance of our broader AI practice, because ungoverned CRM AI is a compliance risk.",
              "bullets": [],
              "n": "02",
              "title": "Breeze AI, governed"
            },
            {
              "_key": "078512330915",
              "_type": "vcStep",
              "body": "We migrate teams onto HubSpot and off it. That dual practice keeps our fit assessments honest in a way single-vendor agencies can’t match.",
              "bullets": [],
              "n": "03",
              "title": "Two-way migration honesty"
            }
